 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Keep incomplete indexing visible.** When a workspace scan finishes with partial results or fails, show a warning with a recovery action after the progress indicator closes. Successful scans and scratch sessions stay quiet. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Keep neighboring code during import cleanup.** Removing an unused import preserves other statements, used imports and comments sharing its line. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Optimize PHP imports in one reviewed operation.** Workbench can remove unused imports and sort surviving standalone import blocks together, with one review and one Undo step. Source changes require a fresh request. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
